          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_transformer_original_dot_product_att",
          "text": "The Transformer's original dot-product attention scales quadratically with sequence length, so a large family of efficient alternatives has appeared, from Longformer and Bigbird to Performer, Reformer, and Synthesizer.",
