          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_catch_single_one_wins_everywhere",
          "text": "The catch is that no single one wins everywhere: earlier long-range benchmarking showed that the best attention depends heavily on the task when there is no pretraining.",
