          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_borrowing_fixed_alpha_trick_differen",
          "text": "Borrowing the fixed-alpha trick from differentiable architecture search, it does not learn softmax edge weights and skips bi-level optimization; instead it simply averages the candidate block outputs, which lets the supernetwork train all the way to convergence.",
